extracted_songs.lyrics:
Head and shoulders, knees and toes;
Knees and toes, knees and toes.
Head and shoulders, knees and toes;
Eyes, ears, mouth and nose.

Open them, shut them;
Open them, shut them;
Give a little clap, 1-2-3.
Open them, shut them;
Open them, shut them;
Hide them behind your back.
Open them, shut them;
Open them, shut them.
Creep them up to your chin,
But do not let them in.
Open them, shut them;
Open them, shut them.
Put them in your lap.
